# Monorepo layout (ignore nested node_modules)

```
apps/
├── website/     # Public marketing
├── web-app/     # customer | store | backoffice dashboard
└── mobile-app/  # Expo

convex/          # Shared backend
packages/
├── config/      # tsconfig + tailwind presets
├── types/       # Source of truth domain types
├── validators/  # Zod schemas (auth, orders, products, settings, payments)
├── utils/
└── ui/
```

# Convex modules

```
convex/
├── auth/ users/ stores/ categories/ products/
├── orders/ payments/ analytics/ settings/ shared/
```

Each module: `queries.ts`, `mutations.ts`, `helpers.ts`, `validators.ts`, `permissions.ts`

# Stack

React, Vite, Expo, TailwindCSS, TypeScript, Convex, Convex Auth, Polar, Vercel, OpenAI, React Flow

# Rules

- `@my-bahrain/types` + `@my-bahrain/validators` prevent type drift across apps
- Business values only in Convex `settings` — never hardcoded
- `packages/constants` (future): routes, query keys, storage keys only
